      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for this. it's a decent start but i think it's a bit too brief for what we need. the comprehensiveness score came back pretty low on this one. \n\nit feels like you're just hitting the highlights. can you expand this into a much more thorough and deep dive? i need more granularity on each point. even if it gets long, we need that level of detail to ensure we aren't missing anything. try to go much deeper into each pro and con mentioned in those reviews so the summary is as substantial as possible.",
      "source": "evaluator"
